# Working data files stay local — never publish operational data to the repo.
# These land in the project root all the time (POI/user exports, duplicate
# lists, screenshots) and carry real customer records; the repo is a code
# remote, not a data store.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
# The two blank templates are the exception: they are app assets, served by
# PoiImportController::template() / UserImportController::template() straight
# from base_path(), so the "Unduh template kosong" button 404s on a fresh
# deploy if they stop being tracked.
!Template_Import_POI_PROMIS.xlsx
!Template_Import_User_PROMIS.xlsx
# Images that ship as part of the UI, not working files.
!public/**/*.png
!public/**/*.jpg
!public/**/*.jpeg
!resources/**/*.png
!resources/**/*.jpg
!resources/**/*.jpeg
